{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんわかつきっ(｀_´)ゞ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼蝶ネクタイ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/25/9292557/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/25/9292557/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"にゃおす(´・ω・)!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この間、『loveとIikeはどう違うのか』という記事を見つけました!!走れ!bicycleではないかっ!!と思わず口にした若月です。お久しぶりです。そうでもないか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、東京公演に向けて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎日レッスン頑張ってます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/25/9292557/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一実さんと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乾燥機に服を入れすぎると"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なぜあんなに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"服が絞った後みたいな感じになるのかについて議論しあった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まず、服を入れすぎだっていう話をしたんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"が、一実さんは一度量を減らしてみたことがあるらしくすでにもう無理ということが判明。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では、回しすぎなんだよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"という話になり、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どれくらい回すかについて話した。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若月『確か、0・7時間ってでてた』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高山『え!?』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若月『やっぱ回しすぎ？』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高山『いやぁーあたし５時間よ。』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若月『ちょ(笑)５時間!?(笑)』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一実さんは洗濯機を"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"５時間も回してるらしい(笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"回しすぎ(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"１日の５分の１を洗濯で過ごしているという。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなに時間を無駄にしているとは(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これを聞いてのみさみさが一言"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『みさ、一実さんの洗濯物にはなりたくない(笑)』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょ、みさみさ(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のレッスンの休み時間は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな話ばかりしてました(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では実は今もレッスン休憩なのでまだまだレッスン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張ります"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/25/9292557/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/25/9292557/0004.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}